  "note": "Controlled test of engine+0x996 bit 7 (3D66). Its only reader, 800A3530, is called from 8009F4B4 — the first step of the 3D3E/3D40 dialogue commands — which looks the speaker up with 800A2C18(speaker, bit 7). A hit stores the unit's tile and the dialogue first scrolls the camera there with 80209DAC; with 0x80 as the mode the lookup always returns 0 and the fallback 800A3854 is skipped too, so the camera should stay put. Two speakers stand far apart and the camera is parked between them first. This variant sets bit 7 to 0 before the two lines.",
